Clean Benchmark Job (no layer applied; runs the trusted benchmark)
```

The Benchmark Job uses the original, unmodified evaluation scripts and the {{ disp.model }} tokenizer, so your changes to the benchmark, {{ d.gate_name_sp }} scripts, or statistics code do not affect scoring.

